     1	"""HarnessValidityOracle (guidelines §10, §8 INVALID_RUN).
     2	
     3	Runs FIRST. It does not judge the product — it judges whether the harness
     4	collected enough durable evidence to adjudicate at all. A failure here maps to
     5	INVALID_RUN (which never counts as a pass and blocks promotion until the harness
     6	is fixed), NOT to a product FAIL.
     7	
     8	Checks, in order:
     9	  1. evidence integrity — the frozen evidence hashes still match (caller passes the
    10	     verdict in; a mismatch means the run folder was mutated after classification,
    11	     §6 → INVALID_RUN).
    12	  2. events present + parseable (an empty / missing event log can't be adjudicated).
    13	  3. a user message exists (a run that never began can't be judged — §8 "test
    14	     aborted before scenario actually began").
    15	"""
    16	
    17	from __future__ import annotations
    18	
    19	from typing import Any
    20	
    21	from .. import failure_codes as fc
