     1	"""The Build Soak failure taxonomy (guidelines §12) + run outcomes (§8).
     2	
     3	Every `FAIL` must carry a code that lives here, with a known severity. No generic
     4	"failed" bucket is allowed in promotion runs. `UNKNOWN_FAILURE` exists for
     5	development only and is P0 until the classifier learns the case (§13).
     6	
     7	Codes are plain string constants (not an enum) so a frozen evidence
     8	`classification.json` round-trips byte-for-byte without enum-name coupling, and so
     9	this module stays import-free / disco-free.
